MiAIPlus

This project includes an Android implementation of phone automation action protocols
and agent-loop ideas adapted from Open-AutoGLM (zai-org/Open-AutoGLM), Apache License 2.0.
The upstream notice, license and source revision are in third_party/open-autoglm/.
No Xiaomi application binaries, model weights or decompiled sources are distributed.

MiAIPlus bundles libxposed service and interface 102.0.0 (libxposed contributors),
Apache License 2.0. The API is a compile-only dependency supplied by the framework.
Upstream references and the license are in third_party/libxposed/.

MiAIPlus bundles Miuix UI and preference components 0.9.4
(compose-miuix-ui contributors), Apache License 2.0, and their Compose dependencies.
Upstream references and the license are in third_party/miuix/.
